        "id": 1116125
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-22T06:12:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the format of this? Put one general comment on top of struct svdm_response, not each function?\n/**\n * function description\n *\n * @param\n * @param\n * @return\n */",
      "parentUuid": "6ab9a6f8_1fab36c8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4940,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4940,
        "endChar": 12
