      "writtenOn": "2020-08-25T00:52:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done with copy rx to tx, and pass tx as parameter to responder functions.\nI did a close check with TCPMv1 implementation code, if response message is VDM header only, func will return 1, they return the count of data object(including VDM header), not count of VDO.",
